    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba7b48bd6de9c98a01350a0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有鉴于昨天发生过那件事，我稍微巡了一轮\n学园内的训练场地……但都没看见八重无敌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e490819270d0b86579d0e4dd193f145d63d7739a09aa1d674020cb342665f61",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1072/storytimeline_041072005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d66324f890fc533adc51631",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她应该已经回宿舍休息，或是和朋友出去玩了。\n只要她有好好休息就好，于是我也上街去买东西！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d1a49c559c9e17fcf5b6d8b7d7b7dcd12c2a58c7b54697c0083e93d97cfdf0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1072/storytimeline_041072005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:429dfd3a90f44c9766ad5dc7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "买完东西回去的路上，我临时起意经过高架桥下。\n那里对我来说是个充满回忆的地方。我还记得那一天──",
      "source_fingerprint": "baf3aaf6ef368975b89eb612f5b0742da3a05ea20e69bc79d7e504a9261ec202",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1072/storytimeline_041072005.json",
